[[eco-modules]]
=== Module resolution

**STUB**: Specifies how an `import` is resolved to a module: the search order,
the precedence of local and installed modules, and how ambiguity is reported.
Defines what installing a module means, how modules are named and versioned,
and how a module declares the foreign packages (Python, R, C++, Rust) it
requires. Explains how those declarations feed the environment solver.

